  "question": {
    "text": "Match List - I with List - II.\n\\(\\begin{array}{lll} \n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\text { List - I } \\\\\n\\text { (Complex ion) }\n\\end{array} & \\begin{array}{l}\n\\text { List - II } \\\\\n\\text { (Spin only magnetic moment in B.M.) }\n\\end{array} \\\\\n\\text { (A) }\\left[\\mathrm{Cr}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+} & \\text { (I) } 4.90 \\\\\n\\text { (B) }\\left[\\mathrm{NiCl}_4\\right]^{2-} & \\text { (II) } 3.87 \\\\\n\\text { (C) }\\left[\\mathrm{CoF}_6\\right]^{3-} & \\text { (III) } 0.0 \\\\\n\\text { (D) }\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CN})_4\\right]^{2-} & \\text { (IV) } 2.83\n\\end{array}\\)\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :",
    "image": null
  },
